WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start position:0%
Oh, thank you.

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:03.436 align:end position:100%
I wish I could just
stay at my old place,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.937 align:end position:100%
but I can't afford
the new rent.

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:06.572 align:start position:0%
Yeah, moving sucks.

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start position:0%
You know, strangers
handling your belongings.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.676 align:start position:0%
The movers
always break something.

00:00:10.776 --> 00:00:13.379 align:end position:100%
Oh, no, I can't afford
professional movers.

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:14.847 align:end position:100%
I'm moving myself
this Saturday.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:15.848
[eerie music]

00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:17.049 align:end position:100%
Gonna do most
of the small stuff

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.252 align:end position:100%
just going back and forth
with my hatchback.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.820
[echoing] Do you think you can
borrow your roommate's van?

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.224 align:end size:97% position:97%
You can help me
with some of the big stuff?

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:33.399
Um...yeah...

00:00:33.499 --> 00:00:34.767
You know what?

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.368
I've been thinking
a lot lately,

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:39.039
and I think we need
to spend some time apart.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.841 align:start position:0%
Not to break up, no.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start position:0%
Just, I just--
just some time.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start position:0%
Time apart to...
figure ourselves out.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.616 align:start position:0%
And--and then we come
back together stronger,

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:52.251 align:start position:0%
you know?

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.454 align:start size:47% position:53%
This is coming
out of nowhere.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.521 align:start position:0%
No, it's not.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.390 align:start position:0%
I've--I have tried
to tell you,

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.860 align:start position:0%
like, a million
different ways.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.127 align:start position:0%
But you don't listen.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:03.429 align:start position:0%
See, that's the thing,

00:01:03.529 --> 00:01:04.964
is that you never listen.

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:07.333
I don't need
this time apart for me.

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:09.102
I need this time apart
for us.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.170
How long do you think
it's gonna take you to move?

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.172
Okay, this is about the move.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.473
You don't want
to help me move.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.308
Wha--what?

00:01:16.408 --> 00:01:18.310
I--I would love
to help you move.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:19.979
That's what boyfriends do.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.247
Claire.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:22.849 align:start position:0%
I just think that
it's a weird coincidence

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.050 align:start position:0%
that you need space

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.584
right when I'm about to move.

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.252 align:start size:38% position:63%
Oh, my God!

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:28.454 align:start size:38% position:63% line:92%
Oh, my God!

00:01:28.554 --> 00:01:30.289 align:start size:44% position:56%
I am so sorry

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:33.259 align:end position:100%
that I didn't plan
my emotional turmoil

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:34.861 align:start size:56% position:44%
around your move.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:36.362 align:start size:75% position:25%
Look at your face, see?

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.931 align:end position:100%
And now you've assumed
the worst of me,

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:40.099 align:start size:66% position:34%
because you do that,

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:41.701 align:end position:100%
and that's why we need
to spend time

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.102 align:start size:72% position:28%
apart from each other.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.572 align:start position:0%
That is not fair.

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.140
Not fair--fair?

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:53.446
Babe, all I'm asking for
is 12 lousy hours this Saturday.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:54.880
Okay, fine!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.317 align:start size:44% position:56%
"Okay, fine"?

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:58.784
We'll move on Sunday.

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.186 align:start size:31% position:69%
48 hours.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.520 align:end position:100%
I don't know
what I was thinking.

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.257 align:start size:78% position:22%
12 hours is nowhere near

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:08.561 align:start size:56% position:44%
enough time to do
what I need to do

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:11.130 align:end size:94% position:94%
to make
our relationship stronger.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.065 align:start size:72% position:28%
See, you got me all...

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:14.066 align:start size:31% position:69%
confused.

00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:15.268 align:start size:59% position:41%
And you know what?

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.969 align:end position:100%
I love you,
but I got to get out of here.

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:18.737 align:end position:100%
I can't--I just can't--
I don't--

00:02:18.837 --> 00:02:19.738
I'm so confused right now.

00:02:19.838 --> 00:02:20.840
[phone dings]

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.008 align:start size:72% position:28%
I feel--I can't think,

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.842 align:end position:100%
and the walls
are closing in on me.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.377 align:end position:100%
I just don't know
what to do.

00:02:25.477 --> 00:02:27.646 align:start position:0%
Oh, it's my landlord.

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:29.415 align:start position:0%
He says he doesn't want
to lose me as a tenant,

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:32.985 align:end size:59% position:59%
so he is not going
to raise my rent.

00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:36.455 align:start position:0%
Now I don't have
to leave my place.

00:02:36.555 --> 00:02:38.657 align:end position:100%
And I don't need
time apart,

00:02:38.757 --> 00:02:41.561 align:end position:100%
because we're perfect
together.

00:02:43.929 --> 00:02:45.932 align:start size:59% position:41%
Will you marry me?

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:51.137 align:start position:0%
You're painting
my apartment.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:52.371
Of course I'm painting
your apartment.

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:53.705
That's what boyfriends do.

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.441
When exactly do you think
that's gonna happen?

